    "Figure4B keeps original top-left and width; height follows the authorized new frozen field aspect ratio, with a newly calibrated external200µm scale bar.",
    "Current verified IF predictions, shared density scale, same-gate abundance denominator, gate percentages, and metrics replace historical science.",
